  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/4dzJ9yxX/Advanced-Netherite-Banner-V13.png\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p>\n<h1><strong>進階下界合金 (Forge / NeoForge)</strong></h1>\n<p>這是<strong>Forge / NeoForge</strong>版本，如需Fabric版本請點擊<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>！</p>\n<h5><strong>NeoForge：</strong>Minecraft 1.20.4 及以上版本</h5>\n<h5><strong>Forge：</strong>Minecraft 1.16.x - 1.21.5</h5>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<h3><strong>📖 關於</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>進階下界合金</strong>是一款可自訂、相容原版且開源的模組，為遊戲增添了更多層級的下界合金！\n本模組的目標是透過增加新的達成目標，來延伸原版的Minecraft體驗。</p>\n<p>如需更多資訊，請前往<a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">進階下界合金維基</a>！</p>\n<p>感謝<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LizterZapZap\" rel=\"nofollow\">LizterZapZap</a>製作全新且更優化的貼圖！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<h3><strong>✅ 功能特色</strong></h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/MTd6yX4W/Advanced-Netherite-Features-V11.png\" alt=\"功能特色\"></a></p>\n<ul>\n<li>新增<strong>4個</strong>下界合金層級！</li>\n<li>每個新層級都包含完整的工具、護甲與方塊套組</li>\n<li>各層級下界合金皆擁有獨特屬性（特殊護甲效果、工具額外掉落物）</li>\n<li>支援附加模組與資料包（datapacks）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<h3><strong>💎 下界合金層級</strong></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/MT1VXszQ/Types-Of-Netherite-Banner-V2.png\" alt=\"層級\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<h3><strong>🔨 合成配方</strong></h3>\n<p>本模組的合成配方詳見<a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki/Crafting-Recipes\" rel=\"nofollow\">進階下界合金維基</a>，或直接安裝<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a>即可查看！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<h3><strong>🔖 熱門版本連結</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=26.1.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 26.1.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.21.11\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.11</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.21.8\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.21.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.21.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.21.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.21.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.20.6\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.20.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.20.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.19.4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.19.3\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.19.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.19.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.18.2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.18.2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.18.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.18.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.17.1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.17.1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/files/all?version=1.16.5\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.16.5</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<h3><strong>ℹ 更多資訊</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>請將問題回報至GitHub上的<a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤器</a>！</li>\n<li>我可以將您的模組收錄於我的CurseForge模組包中嗎？當然可以！</li>\n<li>進階下界合金亦提供<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a>版本。</li>\n<li>點擊<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>查看更多截圖！</li>\n<li>前往<a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">進階下界合金維基</a>了解本模組新增的所有內容詳細資訊。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<h3><strong>💬 加入我的Discord伺服器！</strong></h3>\n<p><em><a href=\"https://discord.gg/KP3BBatuw5\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我的Discord伺服器</a>，即可在有新更新、模組支援及其他動態時收到通知！</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCZY3QJ5/advancednetheritebreak-new.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></p>\n<h4><strong>⚠️ 免責聲明</strong></h4>\n<p>本模組僅透過<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fadvanced-netherite\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>以及<a href=\"https://github.com/Autovw/AdvancedNetherite/releases\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方GitHub倉庫</a>進行發布。\n請勿轉發本模組，或從其他來源下載。</p>\n<p>如需了解更多關於模組轉傳的資訊及防護方法，請前往：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstopmodreposts.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">stopmodreposts.org</a>。</p>",
